data: {"id": "360036302b404634-final", "run_id": "360036302b404634", "seq": 2799, "ts_ms": 1789126023091, "status": "success", "answer": "## 📊 异常概览与现象\n\n| 组 | 异常实体 | 异常状态 | 关键错误信息 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| g1 | `aiops-case-v05/workload` | ContainerCreating | Pod spec 中定义的 ConfigMap volume 'input' 引用了 ConfigMap 'workload-input' 中不存在的 key 'unavailable-key'，且未标记为 optional，导致 kubelet 挂载卷持续失败。 |\n\n---\n\n## 🕵️ 证据内容 · g1\n\n| # | 类型 | 来源 | 真实原始结果 | 诊断作用 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | K8s Event | Kubernetes | `Warning FailedMount`：`MountVolume.SetUp failed for volume \"input\" : configmap references non-existent config key: unavailable-key` (fact-8172d5e7044a) | 直接证明 ConfigMap key 缺失导致挂载卷失败 |\n| 2 | K8s State | Kubernetes | Pod 状态 `Pending`，容器 `app` 等待原因 `ContainerCreating` (fact-8b778e339b46, fact-a6dad8262207) | 描述故障表现：容器因挂载问题卡在启动阶段 |\n| 3 | K8s State | Kubernetes | Pod 条件 `ContainersReady: False`，消息 `containers with unready status: [app]` (fact-3469800b7750) | 确认容器未就绪的直接状态 |\n| 4 | Metric | Prometheus | `kube_pod_container_status_waiting_reason=1` (reason=ContainerCreating) (fact-bac134843177) | 通过指标证实容器持续处于 Waiting 状态 |\n\n**证据总结：**\nKubernetes 事件明确记录了挂载失败的直接原因是引用了不存在的 ConfigMap key `unavailable-key`，这解释了为什么 Pod 处于 `Pending` 且容器状态为 `ContainerCreating` (fact-1, fact-2)。指标数据进一步佐证了容器持续处于等待状态而非运行或错误退出 (fact-4)。日志与 Tracing 因容器未启动不可用，但 Kubernetes 维度的状态与事件已构成闭环证据。\n\n## 🎯 根因分析 · g1\n\n### 因果链\n\n```text\nPod Spec 定义了引用不存在 key 'unavailable-key' 的 ConfigMap volume → kubelet 挂载卷校验失败并持续重试 → Pod 卡在 Pending/ContainerCreating 阶段 → 容器无法启动\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n\n**已确认的根因**：Pod 的卷配置错误地引用了 ConfigMap `workload-input` 中不存在的 key `unavailable-key`，且未标记为 `optional`。\n\n**证据支撑**：\n- **Kubernetes 事件 (fact-1)** 明确指出 `configmap references non-existent config key: unavailable-key`，这是导致挂载失败的唯一具体错误信息。\n- **Kubernetes 状态 (fact-2, fact-3)** 显示 Pod 因挂载失败卡在 `Pending`，容器处于 `ContainerCreating` 状态。\n- **Metric (fact-4)** 确认了等待状态的持续性。\n\n该配置错误直接导致 kubelet 无法完成卷挂载，进而阻塞了容器的启动过程。\n\n---\n\n## 📊 性能统计\n\n```text\n├─ 总耗时: 1.7m\n├─ 问题定位: 47.9s\n├─ 并发证据采集: 46.7s\n│  └─ g1 aiops-case-v05/workload: 46.7s (Evidence 40.7s, RCA 5.9s)\n└─ 汇总总结: 9.0s\n```\n\n📋 Runbook 参考\n\n- **g1 aiops-case-v05/workload**: pod-imagepull-failed, pod-volume-mount-failed\n", "answer_source": "workflow", "elapsed_seconds": 103.565, "metrics": {"run_id": "360036302b404634", "mttr": {"value": "1.7m", "seconds": 103.58103442192078, "pass": true, "threshold": "< 10.0m"}, "evidence_completeness": {"value": "0%", "collected": 0, "planned": 0, "pass": false, "threshold": "> 90%"}, "root_cause_confidence": {"value": "45%", "pass": false, "threshold": ">= 80%"}, "runbook_coverage": {"matched": true, "runbook_id": "pod-imagepull-failed, pod-volume-mount-failed", "pass": true, "score": 0.85, "breakdown": [{"description": "Runbook 引用", "weight": 0.5, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.5}, {"description": "核心 Runbook 识别", "weight": 0.3, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.09}, {"description": "Runbook 结论关联", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.06}]}, "confidence_breakdown": [{"name": "evidence_strength", "weight": 0.35, "score": 0.0, "weighted_score": 0.0, "description": "加权证据完整率", "detail": "加权完整率 0%"}, {"name": "causal_chain", "weight": 0.2, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.2, "description": "因果链完整性", "detail": "完整因果链"}, {"name": "tool_coverage", "weight": 0.1, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.03, "description": "关键探针覆盖率", "detail": "工具成功率 30%"}, {"name": "runbook_match", "weight": 0.15, "score": 0.8, "weighted_score": 0.12, "description": "Runbook 匹配质量", "detail": "已匹配（未识别核心）"}, {"name": "llm_self_score", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.5, "weighted_score": 0.1, "description": "LLM 自评分数", "detail": "来源: layer_confidence, 分数: 50%"}], "confidence_penalties": [], "evidence_breakdown": {"total": 0, "breakdown": {}}, "performance": {"total_duration_ms": 103581.03442192078, "llm_calls": 14, "llm_duration_ms": 99745.48983573914, "tool_calls": 16, "executed_tool_calls": 14, "deduplicated_tool_calls": 1, "successful